<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - CONSTANTA OIL TERMINAL.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - CONSTANTA OIL TERMINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following tankers were</p>
<p>loading, discharging at the Oil Terminal in the Black Sea port</p>
<p>of Constanta on Thursday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Bucsani		  crude	    dsg	 25,000</p>
<p> - Volgoneft 262	  fuel oil	 dsg	  3,500</p>
<p> - Volgoneft 144	  crude	    dsg	  3,500</p>
<p> - Cloud		    crude	    dsg  *    75,800</p>
<p>* crude in transit</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
